# Copy to phone/.env (git ignores it).
# Optional: laptop address for interactive Street View/3D or local-only mode.
# Supabase submissions, feeds and saved image previews work without this URL or ngrok.
EXPO_PUBLIC_SERVER_URL=
# The laptop on the same Wi-Fi, e.g. http://192.168.1.20:3000 (scripts/start.sh fills it in). Street View
# and the 3D model load from here when the phone can reach it, which is much faster than ngrok.
EXPO_PUBLIC_SERVER_LAN_URL=
# Supabase project URL + anon (public) key. Leave empty to try the app in local-only mode (no sign-in, petitions or ranks).
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
# Google Maps Platform key: Places API (New) for search (and Google Maps in store builds for Android).
EXPO_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=
